---
---
<figure class="domestication-figure" tabindex="0" aria-label="可横向滚动的驯化、改良与地方适应原理示意图" aria-describedby="domestication-caption">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1180 450" role="img" aria-labelledby="domestication-title domestication-desc">
    <title id="domestication-title">驯化、育种改良与地方适应的比较设计</title>
    <desc id="domestication-desc">三组概念比较分别连接野生近缘种与栽培群体、地方品种与改良系、热带与温带玉米，并列出适用的群体统计。下方将候选筛查连接到表型关联和独立验证。全部标签是原理示意，不是真实数据。</desc>
    <text x="30" y="35" class="figure-title">研究对照决定选择信号所对应的生物学问题</text>

    <g class="panel">
      <rect x="28" y="58" width="354" height="230" rx="13" class="panel-box"/>
      <rect x="28" y="58" width="354" height="43" rx="13" class="header-domestication"/>
      <text x="48" y="86" class="header-text">驯化</text>
      <text x="48" y="129" class="muted-label">对照群体</text>
      <rect x="48" y="145" width="128" height="49" rx="8" class="group-box wild"/>
      <text x="112" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="group-text">野生近缘种</text>
      <path d="M183 170h34m-8-7 8 7-8 7" class="connector"/>
      <rect x="224" y="145" width="136" height="49" rx="8" class="group-box crop"/>
      <text x="292" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="group-text">栽培群体</text>
      <text x="48" y="224" class="metric-label">群体内 π · 群体间 FST · XP-CLR</text>
      <text x="48" y="252" class="note-label">性状例：落粒、株型、种子性状</text>
    </g>

    <g class="panel">
      <rect x="413" y="58" width="354" height="230" rx="13" class="panel-box"/>
      <rect x="413" y="58" width="354" height="43" rx="13" class="header-improvement"/>
      <text x="433" y="86" class="header-text">育种改良</text>
      <text x="433" y="129" class="muted-label">对照群体</text>
      <rect x="433" y="145" width="128" height="49" rx="8" class="group-box landrace"/>
      <text x="497" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="group-text">地方品种</text>
      <path d="M568 170h34m-8-7 8 7-8 7" class="connector"/>
      <rect x="609" y="145" width="136" height="49" rx="8" class="group-box elite"/>
      <text x="677" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="group-text">现代育成系</text>
      <text x="433" y="224" class="metric-label">多样性变化 · 单倍型 · GWAS/QTL</text>
      <text x="433" y="252" class="note-label">目标例：产量、品质、成熟期</text>
    </g>

    <g class="panel">
      <rect x="798" y="58" width="354" height="230" rx="13" class="panel-box"/>
      <rect x="798" y="58" width="354" height="43" rx="13" class="header-adaptation"/>
      <text x="818" y="86" class="header-text">地方适应</text>
      <text x="818" y="129" class="muted-label">对照群体</text>
      <rect x="818" y="145" width="128" height="49" rx="8" class="group-box trop"/>
      <text x="882" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="group-text">热带群体</text>
      <path d="M953 170h34m-8-7 8 7-8 7" class="connector"/>
      <rect x="994" y="145" width="136" height="49" rx="8" class="group-box temperate"/>
      <text x="1062" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="group-text">温带群体</text>
      <text x="818" y="224" class="metric-label">环境关联 · FST · XP-CLR</text>
      <text x="818" y="252" class="note-label">环境例：光周期、温度、纬度</text>
    </g>

    <text x="30" y="329" class="pipeline-label">共用解释流程</text>
    <rect x="162" y="307" width="222" height="76" rx="10" class="process-box"/>
    <text x="273" y="338" text-anchor="middle" class="process-title">结构与历史背景</text>
    <text x="273" y="362" text-anchor="middle" class="process-note">亲缘、混合、瓶颈、可检测区</text>
    <path d="M389 345h36m-8-7 8 7-8 7" class="connector"/>
    <rect x="435" y="307" width="222" height="76" rx="10" class="process-box"/>
    <text x="546" y="338" text-anchor="middle" class="process-title">统计候选区域</text>
    <text x="546" y="362" text-anchor="middle" class="process-note">按方法各自校准阈值与窗口</text>
    <path d="M662 345h36m-8-7 8 7-8 7" class="connector"/>
    <rect x="708" y="307" width="222" height="76" rx="10" class="process-box"/>
    <text x="819" y="338" text-anchor="middle" class="process-title">连接性状与环境</text>
    <text x="819" y="362" text-anchor="middle" class="process-note">表型、GWAS/QTL、共同园</text>
    <path d="M935 345h36m-8-7 8 7-8 7" class="connector"/>
    <rect x="981" y="307" width="171" height="76" rx="10" class="validation-box"/>
    <text x="1066" y="338" text-anchor="middle" class="process-title">独立验证</text>
    <text x="1066" y="362" text-anchor="middle" class="process-note">遗传或功能证据</text>
    <text x="30" y="423" class="figure-foot">群体比较和统计峰用于提出假说；图中对象与流程为概念标注，不表示研究数据或因果结论。</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption id="domestication-caption">原理示意：三类问题使用不同的样本对照，同一候选区域可能同时受到历史瓶颈、渗入与选择影响。窗口、阈值和遗传模型应按具体研究设计设定。图解内容较宽，可左右滑动查看完整图示。</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .domestication-figure{margin:28px 0;padding:18px;background:#f7fafb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;overflow-x:auto}
  .domestication-figure:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #197b73;outline-offset:3px}
  .domestication-figure svg{display:block;width:100%;min-width:960px;height:auto;font-family:var(--font-sans,"Noto Sans SC",sans-serif)}
  .domestication-figure .figure-title{font-size:19px;font-weight:750;fill:#17324d}
  .domestication-figure .panel-box{fill:#fff;stroke:#d8e2e8;stroke-width:1.5}
  .domestication-figure .header-domestication{fill:#e6efe9}.domestication-figure .header-improvement{fill:#edf0e7}.domestication-figure .header-adaptation{fill:#e8eef5}
  .domestication-figure .header-text{font-size:17px;font-weight:750;fill:#17324d}
  .domestication-figure .muted-label{font-size:13px;fill:#687789}
  .domestication-figure .group-box{stroke:#cbd6dd;stroke-width:1.3}.domestication-figure .wild{fill:#f4ead8}.domestication-figure .crop{fill:#e2f0ed}.domestication-figure .landrace{fill:#edf0e7}.domestication-figure .elite{fill:#e8eef5}.domestication-figure .trop{fill:#f4ead8}.domestication-figure .temperate{fill:#e2f0ed}
  .domestication-figure .group-text{font-size:14px;font-weight:650;fill:#243447}
  .domestication-figure .connector{fill:none;stroke:#197b73;stroke-width:2.3;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
  .domestication-figure .metric-label{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;fill:#197b73}.domestication-figure .note-label{font-size:12.5px;fill:#526477}
  .domestication-figure .pipeline-label{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;fill:#17324d}
  .domestication-figure .process-box{fill:#fff;stroke:#d8e2e8;stroke-width:1.4}.domestication-figure .validation-box{fill:#e2f0ed;stroke:#a8c9c1;stroke-width:1.4}
  .domestication-figure .process-title{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;fill:#243447}.domestication-figure .process-note{font-size:11.5px;fill:#687789}
  .domestication-figure .figure-foot{font-size:12.5px;fill:#687789}
  .domestication-figure figcaption{margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.65}
</style>
